WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.135
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome.

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.270
Please enjoy yourself.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.405
Welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:08.941
Thank you for watching.
Thank you for being here.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:10.010
Well, guys, it seems like

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.011
there's so much
going on right now.

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.046
You got Prince William
and Kate Middleton.

00:00:14.046 --> 00:00:17.583
They just launched
their own YouTube channel.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:22.855
Cicadas are returning
after 17 years.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:26.025
Yeah. Oh, they are.
Sunday is Mother's Day.

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:29.429
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.764
And I heard about a woman
who claims to have found

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:34.534
a cigarette in her taco
at Taco Bell.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.435
There's a lot to go over,
so let's just jump in

00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:37.537
and cover it all at once.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.439
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:44.243
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:46.212
First up, Prince William
and Kate Middleton

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.247
have launched their own
YouTube channel.

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:51.383
They plan to upload videos,
though it's not clear how often.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:54.220
They could post every day
or they could post

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.089
once every 17 years.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:58.424
That's right --
the cicadas are back.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:01.994
Experts are expecting trillions
of these loud, obnoxious bugs

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:05.131
to emerge from underground
just in time for

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.732
Mother's Day.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.701
It's this weekend, so if
you haven't bought a gift,

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.769
you should get on that,
though mom would be happy

00:01:10.769 --> 00:01:13.039
with whatever you get her,
as long as it isn't

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:16.175
a taco with
a cigarette inside.

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:18.110
That's right -- a woman said
she found a damn cigarette

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:19.979
in her Taco Bell meal.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.113
That's disgusting.

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:22.915
To be honest,
I'd rather find a

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:24.017
cicada.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:26.485
They only pop up
once every 17 years,

00:01:26.485 --> 00:01:27.853
so it's easy
to forget about them,

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.289
but it's okay, as long as
you don't forget about

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:31.290
Mother's Day.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.425
I mean, how could you?

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.993
Flowers, cards, chocolates --

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.728
Mother's Day stuff
is everywhere.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:36.929
No matter where you turn,

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.464
you can't escape it,
kind of like

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:40.466
the royal family.

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.835
Every TV show and movie
is about them,

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:45.237
and now they're
taking over YouTube, too.

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:47.873
I can't wait to see their
first prank video, when they

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.275
put a cigarette
in someone's taco.

00:01:50.275 --> 00:01:51.410
What a terrible meal.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.546
It is the opposite of
what you'll get on

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:54.981
Mother's Day.

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.015
And you get to eat in it bed.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.483
So, in conclusion,

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.118
this should be fun,

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:00.720
there's going to be a ton,

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.588
mom, you're number one,

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.457
think outside the bun.

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.792
[ Cheers and applause ]
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:11.897
♪♪

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:15.501
Oh, hey, this is exciting.
Today is National Nurses Day.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:16.803
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:20.973
That's what I'm talking about.
Absolutely.

00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:23.643
Yep, after Cinco de Mayo,
everyone spent the day either

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.845
thanking a nurse or needing one.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.280
And listen to this.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.749
The CDC just announced that they
expect to see a sharp decline

00:02:30.749 --> 00:02:33.853
in COVID cases
in the U.S. by July.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.956
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:37.990
That's right.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.825
So get ready for
Etsy's newest item --

00:02:39.825 --> 00:02:43.762
bikinis made from
recycled masks.

00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:46.098
This gives me hope that we can
celebrate the 4th of July

00:02:46.098 --> 00:02:47.766
the way it's meant
to be celebrated --

00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:48.835
at a neighbor's barbecue,

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:51.670
judging their house and
trying to leave.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.073
Speaking of COVID, I read that
the Mets and Yankees

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.774
will soon offer
free tickets to people

00:02:55.774 --> 00:02:58.778
who get vaccinated
at their games.

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:00.279
That's fantastic.

00:03:00.279 --> 00:03:02.248
Then, after parking,
food, and a T-shirt,

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:05.484
the vaccine will only
cost you about 400 or 500 bucks.

00:03:05.484 --> 00:03:07.119
It's actually a great idea,
except they're having

00:03:07.119 --> 00:03:10.857
the peanut vendor
hurl the needle at people.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:12.925
You can also look for the guy in
the parking lot who's yelling,

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:16.663
"Pfizer! Get your ice-cold
Pfizer here!"

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:17.663
I'm kidding.

00:03:17.663 --> 00:03:19.265
Fans just have to
show up on time

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:22.435
and hope that Mr. Met
has steady hands.

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:25.972
Meanwhile, I saw that
New York City is

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.973
taking the effort a step further

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:30.443
and now wants to
start vaccinating tourists.

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:31.611
-Ooh!

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.546
-I can't wait to see
a German tourist be like,

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:37.383
"Yeah, I just got ze
J&amp;J at ze M&amp;M store."

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.320
Yeah, that's right --
tourists are excited.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.554
They're like,
"It's New York City.

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:45.391
We're going to get stabbed
one way or another."

00:03:47.392 --> 00:03:51.397
The vaccines would be
administered in a mobile van.

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.731
Here's a word of warning
to tourists.

00:03:52.731 --> 00:03:56.235
If someone rolls up in a van
and offers you a shot,

00:03:56.235 --> 00:04:00.306
don't get in,
unless it's Mr. Met.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:01.407
Some news from overseas.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.443
I read that Russia just
authorized use of

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:07.846
a one-shot COVID vaccine
called Sputnik Light.

00:04:07.846 --> 00:04:12.685
Which means everyone lining up
in Russia is hearing,

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:14.020
"We're out Sputnik.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.590
Is Sputnik Light okay?
Is that fine?

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.892
It tastes the same, basically.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:23.062
I mean, it's just as effective."

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:24.396
Some news from Washington.

00:04:24.396 --> 00:04:27.132
I saw that house Republicans
want to kick Liz Cheney

00:04:27.132 --> 00:04:30.069
off of their leadership team
because she refuses to

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:33.339
side with Trump
and say the election was stolen.

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:36.275
You can tell Republicans also
upset Dick Cheney,

00:04:36.275 --> 00:04:38.211
'cause they were like,
"We should totally ditch Liz."

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:43.282
She's such a..."

00:04:43.282 --> 00:04:46.519
[ Imitates whooshing ]

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:49.255
-[ As Darth Vader ]
Liz, I am your father.

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:51.790
-Liz Cheney said Republicans
have to choose between

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.160
the truth and trump,
to which Republicans said,

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:57.797
"Um, the truth
never gave us free hats."

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.232
You guys getting tired?
It's alright.

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:01.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:04.536
We're almost at the end.

00:05:04.536 --> 00:05:05.672
Some entertainment news.

00:05:05.672 --> 00:05:07.539
HBO just released
the first images from its

00:05:07.539 --> 00:05:11.411
"Game of Thrones" prequel
series, "House of the Dragon."

00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:12.912
Yeah, here's one of
the photos they released.

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:17.183
We don't know much,
but you can tell that

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:20.186
they're not brother and sister,
because they're not making out.

00:05:23.856 --> 00:05:27.460
Can we zoom into
the background for a second?

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.461
How did they miss that?

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:30.796
-Oh, come on!
-Come on!

00:05:30.796 --> 00:05:33.299
-Come on!
-How did they miss that?

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.268
You'd think someone would --
-Learn their lesson.

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:37.270
-Well, now can we zoom out?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.040
What's going on?
-Oh, come on!

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.475
-I've seen those people
in the Hamptons.

00:05:43.475 --> 00:05:45.510
-Really?
-Did you guys see this?

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.380
Last night, the New York Rangers
and Washington Capitals

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.482
played each other,
and the game was pretty wild

00:05:50.482 --> 00:05:51.483
right from the start.

00:05:51.483 --> 00:05:52.652
Take a look at this.

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:53.852
-Dowd and Garnet Hathaway --
they combined for

00:05:53.852 --> 00:05:54.854
2 goals, 3 assists.

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:56.255
-Here we go.
Right off the draw.

00:05:56.255 --> 00:06:00.927
-And right off the face-off,
three fights simultaneously.

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:03.196
Rooney and Dowd.

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:06.432
-People were calling it
"The View on Ice."

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:11.036
Yeah, there were six fights
in the first five minutes,

00:06:11.036 --> 00:06:13.906
and a photo of the Capitals'
penalty box went viral.

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:16.375
Look at this.

00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:19.445
Yeah, it looks like
a Canadian prison.

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:20.613
Can we see it again?

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:25.351
It looks like
a white-guy vending machine.

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:28.587
Hey, get this --
in Ohio, lawmakers introduced

00:06:28.587 --> 00:06:31.624
a new bill against
distracted driving.

00:06:31.624 --> 00:06:34.360
Okay? And on the same day
that that bill was proposed,

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.328
one senator
tried to hide the fact

00:06:36.328 --> 00:06:39.098
that he was driving
during a meeting.

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:40.332
Watch this.

00:06:40.332 --> 00:06:42.435
-We're going to allow for
the legislative process

00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:44.904
and discussions to continue.

00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:46.072
-On the regular agenda,

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:48.107
are there any holds,
no votes, or abstentions?

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:49.975
Senator Brenner.

00:06:49.975 --> 00:06:51.177
-No holds.

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:54.513
[ Laughter ]

00:06:54.513 --> 00:06:56.715
-The guy was like, "What? what?
The seat belt?

00:06:56.715 --> 00:06:58.651
Yeah, when I get this
rocking chair moving,

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:00.286
who knows what's gonna happen?

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:02.454
I'm not in a car.
You're in a car."

00:07:02.454 --> 00:07:03.890
Then he was like, "Sorry.
My Zoom's cutting out.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:04.957
I'm going through a tunnel.

00:07:04.957 --> 00:07:06.158
I mean, I'm not going
through a tunnel.

00:07:06.158 --> 00:07:07.926
I mean, I'm going through
a tollbooth.

00:07:07.926 --> 00:07:09.562
I mean, not a toll--
Why would I say tollbooth?

00:07:09.562 --> 00:07:10.829
I'm just going to pull over.

00:07:10.829 --> 00:07:14.433
I'm going to pull my house over.
Hold on."

00:07:14.433 --> 00:07:16.735
And, finally, a 12-year-old just
built the world's tallest

00:07:16.735 --> 00:07:17.970
Popsicle-stick structure.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:18.971
Check this out.

00:07:18.971 --> 00:07:22.074
Wow.
-Ooh!

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:26.278
-Oh, yeah, we've got to get
the kids back in school.

00:07:26.278 --> 00:07:28.981
It was cute until he said,
"I'm building my own 5G tower

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:33.519
to avoid government
surveillance."

00:07:33.519 --> 00:07:35.054
Yep, everyone said,
"Great Eiffel Tower,"

00:07:35.054 --> 00:07:36.054
while the kid was like,
"Eiffel Tower?

00:07:36.054 --> 00:07:37.089
This is Shaq's toothpick."

00:07:37.089 --> 00:07:38.090
We have a great show.

